Source of the data: Found this data through online video source, the data has 13 columns and 603 rows

Data Quality Assessments done:
- Missing Values
- Duplicate Records
- Incorrect data-types
- Inconsistent formatting
- Blank Rows and Column
- Otliners and Error

Used Formulas and tricks used to clean and structure data

- trim()
- text()
auto-fit row: alt + h + o + i
auto-fit column: alt + h + o + a

- I found this practice dataset which includes data formulas and tricks used in the uncleaned data.
- to format header in excel:
   - increase font size
   - center-aligned
   - bold the text
   - changed background color

- Also, to avoid headers to go away, freezed the headers via the view tab > freeze panes > freeze top-row

